---
import Layout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ArticleLayout from "@/components/content/ArticleLayout.astro";
import ContactSection from "@/components/section/ContactSection.astro";

/*
 * Policy text. Changes need Legal approval (CLAUDE.md rule 10).
 * Must match site behavior and 02-compliance/tag-registry.csv.
 * Update it before adding any new tool, especially analytics or advertising.
 */
---

<Layout
  fullTitle="Cookie Policy | Exact Benefits"
  description="How Exact Benefits uses cookies and similar technologies on this website, the services involved, and how to manage your choices."
>
  <ArticleLayout tag="Legal" heading="Cookie Policy" subheading="Last updated: November 8, 2026" side={false}>
    <p>This Cookie Policy explains how Exact Benefits Group, LLC ("Exact Benefits", "we" or "us") uses cookies and similar technologies on www.exactbenefits.com. It should be read together with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>What are cookies and similar technologies?</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files that a website places on your device. Similar technologies include browser storage, which lets a website save information in your browser, and requests to services run by other companies, which share your IP address and basic browser information with those companies so they can deliver content to you.</p>

    <h2>How we use them</h2>
    <p>We use these technologies to display this website, operate our forms, and remember your privacy choices. With your consent, we also use analytics and marketing tools to understand how visitors use this website and which companies visit it. These tools do not load until you accept them in the privacy banner.</p>

    <h2>Services used on this website</h2>

    <h3>Usercentrics, provided through Termageddon</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> shows our privacy banner, records your choices, and holds back listed third-party services until the required consent is given. <strong>Information involved:</strong> your consent choices, a consent ID, the date and time of your choice, IP address, and browser and device data. <strong>Category:</strong> necessary. Your choice is saved in your browser's storage so the banner does not need to appear on every visit. The wording of the banner is delivered from Termageddon's file storage, hosted by DigitalOcean, which receives your IP address.</p>

    <h3>Adobe Fonts</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> displays the typeface used for our headings. <strong>Information involved:</strong> IP address and font-usage data sent to Adobe. <strong>Category:</strong> necessary. According to Adobe, this service does not set cookies.</p>

    <h3>Go High Level</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> operates the consultation and newsletter forms on this website. <strong>Information involved:</strong> the information you enter in a form. Go High Level may also set cookies used to understand how a visitor reached a form. <strong>Category:</strong> necessary to provide the forms.</p>

    <h3>Sanity</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> delivers images in our articles. <strong>Information involved:</strong> IP address, sent to Sanity when an image loads. <strong>Category:</strong> necessary. This service does not set cookies.</p>

    <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> measures site visits and form conversions. <strong>Information involved:</strong> page views, device and browser data, approximate location, IP address, and cookies. <strong>Category:</strong> analytics.</p>

    <h3>Microsoft Clarity</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> heatmaps and session recordings. <strong>Information involved:</strong> clicks, scrolling, mouse movement, session replays, device data, and cookies. <strong>Category:</strong> analytics.</p>

    <h3>Leadfeeder (Dealfront)</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> identifies the companies that visit, using IP address. <strong>Information involved:</strong> IP address, pages viewed, and cookies. <strong>Category:</strong> analytics.</p>

    <h3>Apollo.io</h3>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> identifies the companies that visit, for sales outreach. <strong>Information involved:</strong> IP address, pages viewed, company match, and cookies. <strong>Category:</strong> marketing.</p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>Some pages link to videos and websites run by other organizations, such as YouTube. Those websites have their own cookie and privacy practices, which apply once you visit them.</p>

    <h2>Managing your choices</h2>
    <p>When the privacy banner appears, you can accept, deny, or save your own settings. To review or change your choice later, select the privacy settings button at the bottom left of any page. Necessary services cannot be switched off through the banner because the website and its forms depend on them.</p>
    <p>You can also block or delete cookies and browser storage in your browser's settings. Some parts of this website, including our forms, may not work as expected if you do.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it last changed.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this policy, contact Exact Benefits Group, LLC, 550 Polaris Pkwy #510, Westerville, OH 43082, or email <a href="mailto:info@exactbenefits.com">info@exactbenefits.com</a>.</p>
  </ArticleLayout>
  <ContactSection />
</Layout>
